# Pictures and sounds built from the purchased packs (LimeZu, Cyberleaf). Their licences forbid
# redistribution, so they stay on the builder's disk and out of this public repository. See README.
# Every sprite PNG is ignored by default; the ones our scripts draw entirely by hand are listed back in.
